    "url": "https://dorestorativeyoga.blogspot.com/2009/03/supported-bound-angle-forward-fold.html",
    "title": "Do Restorative Yoga: Supported Bound Angle Forward Fold",
    "note": "Described in our own words. Stick-figure approximation."
  },
