  "cues": ["Fold from the hips.", "Let your head rest.", "Breathe into your back."],
  "prescription": {
    "reps": "Hold 30–60 seconds",
    "note": "Breathe slowly; come up on a breath in. Skip the fold with a groin or knee injury."
  },
